---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { productUrl, wanderAppStoreUrl, wanderWebsiteUrl } from '../lib/site-links';
import '../styles/home.css';
import CornerstoneSystem from '../components/CornerstoneSystem.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hyphos Inc. — Consulting & software" description="Connected systems, shared knowledge, and software built around your business. Hyphos Inc. helps growing businesses reduce manual coordination and dependence on a few key people.">
  <section class="consulting-hero page-shell">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="section-label"><span class="gold-dash" aria-hidden="true"></span> Hyphos Inc. · Consulting & software</p>
      <h1>Grow without<br />making your people<br /><em>the bottleneck.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">Connect the systems. Capture the know-how. Give your team more room to do the work that matters.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a href="/contact" class="button button--ink">Talk with us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#selected-work" class="text-link">See what we've built <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <a class="hero-project" href="/work/cornerstone" aria-label="Explore the connected business software case study">
      <div class="project-topline"><span>From our work</span><span>01 / Business software</span></div>
      <div class="project-title"><h2>The business. The website.<br />The marketing. Connected.</h2><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      <div class="project-image"><img src="/work/cornerstone/staff-portal.png" width="2912" height="2340" alt="Client staff portal showing its connected calendar and business tools" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
      <div class="project-caption"><span>Business data, publishing & insight</span><span>One connected system</span></div>
    </a>
  </section>
  <section class="work-strip"><div class="page-shell"><span>Good work, connected.</span><p>Business systems <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Practical AI <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Custom software</p></div></section>
  <section class="constraint page-shell">
    <div><p class="section-label"><span class="index">01</span>The work between the work</p><h2>Someone always<br />holds it all together.</h2></div>
    <div class="constraint-copy"><p>They know which spreadsheet is right. Why the quote changed. Who needs a call before anything moves.</p><p>As the business grows, more work passes through the same few people. We connect your information and build around how your team actually works—so the context travels with the job.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section id="selected-work" class="selected-work"><div class="page-shell">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="section-label"><span class="index">02</span>Selected work</p><a href="/work" class="text-link">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="cs-home-feature">
      <div class="cs-home-intro"><h3>Your business.<br />Connected.</h3><p>Business records feed the public website. Website and marketing activity come back into the staff system. Explore how the pieces fit.</p></div>
      <CornerstoneSystem id="home-system" compact />
      <a href="/work/cornerstone" class="text-link">Take a closer look at the software <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="case-grid">
      <article class="case-story"><span class="case-number">01 / Connected operations</span><h2>Connected software.<br />Built around the business.</h2><p>From family communications and scheduling to documents and accounting: one connected platform, shaped around the people caring for families.</p><div class="case-facts"><div><span>The challenge</span><p>Information scattered across systems and people.</p></div><div><span>The work</span><p>Bring the website, staff tools and business operations together.</p></div></div><a href="/work/cornerstone" class="text-link">Explore the connected platform <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      <article class="wander-story"><div class="wander-visual"><img src="/work/wander/wander-find.webp" width="640" height="1388" alt="Wander map showing nearby parks and playgrounds" loading="lazy" /><img src="/work/wander/wander-check.webp" width="640" height="1388" alt="Wander park details with photos, reviews and amenities" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="wander-caption"><div><span class="case-number">02 / A product from the ground up</span><h3>Wander</h3><p>Less planning. More time outside.</p><p>Now available on the App Store.</p></div><a href="/work#wander" class="circle-link" aria-label="Read the Wander case study">↗</a></div><div class="wander-links"><a href={wanderAppStoreUrl} class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download on the App Store ↗</a><a href={wanderWebsiteUrl} class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Wander ↗</a></div></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="help-section page-shell"><div class="section-heading"><p class="section-label"><span class="index">03</span>How we help</p><h2>Start with the constraint.<br />Build what the work needs.</h2></div>
    <div class="help-row"><span>01</span><h3>Connect what you have.</h3><p>Your accounting, website, scheduling and customer information should work together. We close the gaps that people are bridging by hand.</p><a href="/services#build" aria-label="Read about connecting existing systems">↗</a></div>
    <div class="help-row"><span>02</span><h3>Build around your business.</h3><p>When the tools don't fit, we design and build software around the workflow, the exceptions and the people who use it.</p><a href="/services" aria-label="Read about custom software">↗</a></div>
    <div class="help-row"><span>03</span><h3>Put your knowledge to work.</h3><p>Make decisions, documents and experience useful beyond the person who remembers them. This is the thinking behind Hyphos.</p><a href={productUrl} aria-label="Explore the Hyphos knowledge product">↗</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="founder-section"><div class="page-shell founder-grid"><div><p class="section-label">A conversation, to start.</p><h2>Tell me where<br />the work gets stuck.</h2></div><div><p class="founder-quote">The first step is to understand the work. What's happening, who holds the context, and where things start to slip.</p><p class="founder-name">Daniel Newton <span>Hyphos Inc.</span></p><p class="founder-body">Bring a process that's taking too much time. We'll talk through the problem and whether there's a useful way to help.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--gold">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="product-bridge page-shell"><span class="section-label">Also from Hyphos Inc.</span><p>What if the knowledge<br />stayed with the work?</p><a href={productUrl} class="text-link">Meet Hyphos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
